  id: rescue.sigrid
  displayName: The Folded Wood
  description: Everyone else is home. Only Sigrid, who led the expedition and whose voice you heard in the stones, is still out there, in Troll Valley's folded wood, where bells ring for the names of the lost. Speak the names the others kept.
  chain: The Lost Expedition
  journalNotes: 'Sigrid led the expedition, and it was her voice in the stones the day they broke. She has been out there longest of all. In the folded wood of Troll Valley a bell rings for every name spoken: speak the names of everyone home, and she will answer to hers.'
